mothershipOS: re-add CMDLINE_EXTEND on arm64 so the kernel appends console=tty0 + fbcon font
to nio's U-Boot env bootargs (baked into hyp_b). Generic support lives in drivers/of/fdt.c.

--- a/arch/arm64/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/Kconfig
@@ -2436,6 +2436,13 @@
 	  This is useful if you cannot or don't want to change the
 	  command-line options your boot loader passes to the kernel.
 
+config CMDLINE_EXTEND
+	bool "Extend bootloader kernel arguments"
+	help
+	  The default kernel command string is appended to the command-line
+	  arguments provided by the boot loader (handled in drivers/of/fdt.c).
+	  mothershipOS: nio's U-Boot env bootargs are baked into hyp_b.
+
 endchoice
 
 config EFI_STUB
